    <longDescription>This business object defines the behavior of a customer service request person that is used to either add a new Person or update an existing Person's information during a start/stop/transfer service process.

This object is designed to be instantiated from its parent Customer Service Request's life cycle processing - e.g. adding the person during the customer service request's verification state where a credit check is performed, updating the person when the customer service request is about to complete.   The state transitions of this business object are meant to be triggered by life cycle algorithms on the customer service requests.

For 'new customer' start service requests where the main Person is added, the new Person can be deleted when the start service process flow is canceled.  To enable this feature, plug in the CS Request Person - Cleanup (C1CSRPERCLN) algorithm on the Discarded status.</longDescription>
    <mo>C1-CSREQPER</mo>
    <applicationService>C1-CSRPERSONBOAS</applicationService>
