    <longDescription>This business object defines the behavior of a customer service request account that is used to either add a new Account or update an existing Account's information during a start/stop/transfer process.

This object is designed to be instantiated from its parent Customer Service Request's life cycle processing - e.g. creating the account when the customer service request is about to complete.   The state transitions of this business object are meant to be triggered by life cycle algorithms on the customer service requests.

For start service requests that create the Account, the new Account can be deleted when the start service process flow is canceled.  To enable this feature, plug in the CS Request Account - Cleanup (C1CSRACCCLN) algorithm on the Discarded status.</longDescription>
